      "tokenized_text": "<C:0007,0000,>¿Qué quieres?<C:0003,0000,0A00>\n<C:0005,0001,><C:0000,0003,FFFFFFFF><C:0008,0001,0A00><C:0000,0003,000000FF>Cuéntame algo.\n<C:0005,0001,><C:0000,0003,FFFFFFFF><C:0008,0001,0A00><C:0000,0003,000000FF>Ir al mundo de los sueños.\n<C:0005,0001,><C:0000,0003,FFFFFFFF><C:0008,0001,0A00><C:0000,0003,000000FF>Nada.<C:0003,0000,0A00>",
